Tasks

Your Responsibilities
• Design, implement and execute test cases;
• Evaluate the testing process, and make recommendations as necessary;
• Timely execution of test cases;
• Identify, and record bugs.

Requirements

Skills & Experience
• Bachelor's degree or equivalent experience in Computer Science;
• 2+ years of relevant testing experience;
• Experience with Automated test writing (Cucumber, Selenium, etc.);
• Experience with Cross-browser device testing;
• Experience with Performance testing;
• Knowledge of BDD principles;
• Knowledge of Test Evolve Framework (nice to have);
• Experience with Manual regression testing;
• Fluent in English.

Benefits

Main Benefits
• Suitable training;
• Flexible working options.
• Contract: freelancing;
• Length: long project (+12 months);
• Start date: ASAP;
• Business area: banking;
• Daily rate: negotiable;
• Place: remote.

